    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>本文整理 Android 注册逻辑、Java 解密、ELF 与 Windows 程序等基础逆向分析题目的思路和脚本。</p><span id="more"></span><h1 id="基本函数"><a href="#基本函数" class="headerlink" title="基本函数"></a>基本函数</h1><p><strong>char *strcat(char *dest, const char *src)</strong> 把 <strong>src</strong> 所指向的字符串追加到 <strong>dest</strong> 所指向的字符串的结尾。</p><h1 id="简单注册器"><a href="#简单注册器" class="headerlink" title="简单注册器"></a>简单注册器</h1><p>刚接触到安卓逆向，用jdx打开apk包发现注册逻辑</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20260914162515710.png" alt="image-20260914162515710"></p><p>编写exp：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">x = <span class="built_in">list</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;dd2940c04462b4dd7c450528835cca15&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">x[<span class="number">2</span>] = <span class="built_in">chr</span>(<span class="built_in">ord</span>(x[<span class="number">2</span>]) + <span class="built_in">ord</span>(x[<span class="number">3</span>]) - <span class="number">50</span>)</span><br><span class="line">x[<span class="number">4</span>] = <span class="built_in">chr</span>(<span class="built_in">ord</span>(x[<span class="number">2</span>]) + <span class="built_in">ord</span>(x[<span class="number">5</span>]) - <span class="number">48</span>)</span><br><span class="line">x[<span class="number">30</span>] = <span class="built_in">chr</span>(<span class="built_in">ord</span>(x[<span class="number">31</span>]) + <span class="built_in">ord</span>(x[<span class="number">9</span>]) - <span class="number">48</span>)</span><br><span class="line">x[<span class="number">14</span>] = <span class="built_in">chr</span>(<span class="built_in">ord</span>(x[<span class="number">27</span>]) + <span class="built_in">ord</span>(x[<span class="number">28</span>]) - <span class="number">97</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">0</span>,<span class="number">16</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    a = x[<span class="number">31</span> - i ]</span><br><span class="line">    x[<span class="number">31</span> - i] = x[i]</span><br><span class="line">    x[i] = a </span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;flag&#123;&quot;</span> + <span class="string">&quot;&quot;</span>.join(x) + <span class="string">&quot;&#125;&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>获得flag为<code>flag{59acc538825054c7de4b26440c0999dd}</code></p><h1 id="JAVA逆向解密"><a href="#JAVA逆向解密" class="headerlink" title="JAVA逆向解密"></a>JAVA逆向解密</h1><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20260914164100559.png" alt="image-20260914164100559"></p><p>看  <code>Encrypt（）</code>的逻辑，flag作为参数传入</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> (char c : arr) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="built_in">int</span> result = (c + <span class="string">&#x27;@&#x27;</span>) ^ <span class="number">32</span>;</span><br><span class="line">            Resultlist.add(Integer.valueOf(result));</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这是加密的主要逻辑</p><p>逆向一下加密逻辑就是</p><p>c &#x3D; result ^ 32 - ord(‘@’)</p><p>后面使用KEY来做对比</p><p>所以编写脚本</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">KEY = [<span class="number">180</span>, <span class="number">136</span>, <span class="number">137</span>, <span class="number">147</span>, <span class="number">191</span>, <span class="number">137</span>, <span class="number">147</span>, <span class="number">191</span>, <span class="number">148</span>, <span class="number">136</span>, <span class="number">133</span>, <span class="number">191</span>, <span class="number">134</span>, <span class="number">140</span>, <span class="number">129</span>, <span class="number">135</span>, <span class="number">191</span>, <span class="number">65</span>]</span><br><span class="line">result = <span class="string">&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> value <span class="keyword">in</span> KEY:</span><br><span class="line">    value = value ^ <span class="number">32</span></span><br><span class="line">    value = value - <span class="number">64</span></span><br><span class="line">    cha = <span class="built_in">chr</span>(value)</span><br><span class="line">    result = result + cha</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;flag&#123;&quot;</span>+result+<span class="string">&quot;&#125;&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>flag{This_is_the_flag_!}</code></p><h1 id="luck-guy"><a href="#luck-guy" class="headerlink" title="luck_guy"></a>luck_guy</h1><p>解压之后先查壳，发现无壳，是ELF64位文件</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20260914181208518.png" alt="image-20260914181208518"></p><p>将luck_guy拖进IDA中分析</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20260914175814994.png" alt="image-20260914175814994"></p><p>发现是switch-case函数，逐个分析一下每一个case</p><p>case1的作用是先将s设置为空，将f1和f2都链接在s之后，那么s可能就是要找的flag，点击了一下f1，发现了f1的值</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20260914182309626.png" alt="image-20260914182309626"></p><p>case2和case3 都是输出，先不管</p><p>case4这里给了 s &#x3D; ‘\x7Ffo<code>guci&#39; ,刚开始查文件时候说了是ELF64文件，所以它存储的时候是小端存储，但是在IDA的显示中会变为大端存储，所以需要把s逆置一下，也就是s = icug</code>of,然后会把s插入f2之后</p><p>Case5是对f2进行处理，这个循环的含义是如果j为奇数，就把f2 - 2，如果是偶数，就把f2 - 1</p><p>所以可以猜想一下，case4 -&gt; case5 -&gt; case1 就可以得到flag</p><p>编写脚本走一圈</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">f1 =<span class="built_in">list</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;GXY&#123;do_not_&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">f2 =<span class="built_in">list</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;icug`of&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">0</span>,<span class="number">7</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> i % <span class="number">2</span> == <span class="number">0</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        f2[i] = <span class="built_in">chr</span>(<span class="built_in">ord</span>(f2[i]) - <span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        f2[i] = <span class="built_in">chr</span>(<span class="built_in">ord</span>(f2[i]) - <span class="number">2</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;&quot;</span>.join(f1)+<span class="string">&quot;&quot;</span>.join(f2)+<span class="string">&quot;&#125;&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>得到flag</p><p><code>GXY{do_not_hate_me}</code></p><h1 id="刮开有奖"><a href="#刮开有奖" class="headerlink" title="刮开有奖"></a>刮开有奖</h1><p>先查壳，没什么有效信息</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20260914194136984.png" alt="image-20260914194136984"></p><p>直接丢IDA，看到DIalogFunc直接跟进去</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20260914195352575.png" alt="image-20260914195352575"></p><p>这里大概就能看到加密的主体了，将这些东西都修复了就变成这样了</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20260914195534738.png" alt="image-20260914195534738"></p><p>第一点，输入字符的长度必须是8</p><p>第二点，下面的这些变量肯定是和flag有关</p><p>跟进sub_4010f0函数</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20260914195655942.png" alt="image-20260914195655942"></p><p>发现函数是升序的快速排序，给函数更一下名</p><p>那么意思就是将上面的变量进行升序排序</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">key = <span class="built_in">list</span>(<span class="string">&quot;ZJSECaNH3ng&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">key.sort()</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;&quot;</span>.join(key))</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 3CEHJNSZagn</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>再往下看sub_401000函数，跟进去</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20260914195833966.png" alt="image-20260914195833966"></p><p>观察函数逻辑，发现是base64加密，跟进去byte_407830中，看一下base64表是没有变的<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20260914195931446.png" alt="image-20260914195931446"></p><p>在主函数的逻辑中，v4 v5都是被base64加密之后的变量</p><p>最后看if的判断条件</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20260914200246043.png" alt="image-20260914200246043"></p><p>排序后的元素为<code>3CEHJNSZagn</code></p><p>1️⃣v7[0]表示的是第一个元素 也就是3 ，string[0] &#x3D; v7[0] + 34</p><p>2️⃣v10代表的是第五个元素 对应的也就是J </p><p>3️⃣逆运算一下 string[2] &#x3D; (3 * v8 + 141) &#x2F; 4,这里的v8是第三个元素，也就是E</p><p>4️⃣逆运算一下 string[3] &#x3D; 2 * (v13 &#x2F; 9) * 4,这里的v13是第八个元素 ，也就是Z</p><p>5️⃣6️⃣都是做比较，将<code>ak1w</code>和<code>V1Ax</code> base64解密一下再做比较，因为上面说过了 v4 v5都是base64加密之后的变量，解密之后为<code>ak1w</code> -&gt; <code>jMp</code> <code>V1Ax</code> -&gt;<code> WP1</code></p><p>从上往下求一下</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">key = <span class="string">&quot;3CEHJNSZagn&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">string0 = <span class="built_in">chr</span>(<span class="built_in">ord</span>(key[<span class="number">0</span>]) + <span class="number">34</span>)</span><br><span class="line">string1 = key[<span class="number">4</span>]</span><br><span class="line">string2 = <span class="built_in">chr</span>(<span class="built_in">int</span>((<span class="number">3</span> * <span class="built_in">ord</span>(key[<span class="number">2</span>]) + <span class="number">141</span>) / <span class="number">4</span>))</span><br><span class="line">string3 = <span class="built_in">chr</span>(<span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">ord</span>(key[<span class="number">7</span>]) / <span class="number">9</span> * <span class="number">2</span> * <span class="number">4</span>))</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(string0 + string1 + string2 + string3)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>得到<code>UJWP</code>，因为已知长度是8，上面两个字符串base64解密后为<code>jMp</code>和<code> WP1</code>,做一下比较可以得到<code>WP1</code>在前面</p><p>所以flag为<code>flag{UJWP1jMp}</code></p><h1 id="BJDCTF2020-JustRE"><a href="#BJDCTF2020-JustRE" class="headerlink" title="[BJDCTF2020]JustRE"></a><strong>[BJDCTF2020]JustRE</strong></h1><p>进去之后查看字符串，发现一个和flag很像的东西，跟进去</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20260914204135246.png" alt="image-20260914204135246"></p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20260914204110161.png" alt="image-20260914204110161"> </p><p>发现点击次数为19999输出flag，再往下看format，把19999和0带入进去得到flag</p><p>flag{1999902069a45792d233ac}</p><h1 id="rome"><a href="#rome" class="headerlink" title="rome"></a>rome</h1><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">miwen = [<span class="string">&#x27;p&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;v&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;k&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;q&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;&#123;&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;m&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;1&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;6&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;4&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;6&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;7&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;5&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;2&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;6&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;2&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;0&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;3&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;3&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;l&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;4&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;m&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;4&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;9&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;l&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;n&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;p&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;7&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;p&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;9&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;m&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;n&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;k&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;2&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;8&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;k&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;7&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;5&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;&#125;&#x27;</span>]</span><br><span class="line">mingwen = [<span class="string">&#x27;&#x27;</span>] * <span class="number">38</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">0</span>,<span class="number">38</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> (miwen[i] &gt;= <span class="string">&#x27;A&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">and</span> miwen[i] &lt;= <span class="string">&#x27;Z&#x27;</span>) <span class="keyword">or</span> (miwen[i] &gt;= <span class="string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">and</span> miwen[i] &lt;= <span class="string">&#x27;z&#x27;</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        y = <span class="built_in">ord</span>(miwen[i]) + <span class="number">16</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> (y &gt; <span class="built_in">ord</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;Z&#x27;</span>) <span class="keyword">and</span> y &lt; <span class="built_in">ord</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>)) <span class="keyword">or</span> (y &gt;= <span class="built_in">ord</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;z&#x27;</span>)):</span><br><span class="line">            y -= <span class="number">26</span></span><br><span class="line">        mingwen[i] = <span class="built_in">chr</span>(y)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        mingwen[i] = miwen[i]</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;&quot;</span>.join(mingwen))</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(mingwen)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="GWCTF-2019-pyre"><a href="#GWCTF-2019-pyre" class="headerlink" title="[GWCTF 2019]pyre"></a>[GWCTF 2019]pyre</h1><p>拿到题目反编译后得到这样的python代码</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20261012190202174.png" alt="image-20261012190202174"></p><p>分析第二个循环一下能够知道，反着算就行，code的最后一位是不变的</p><p>由于最后一位code[i + 1]没变，从后往前走，code[i + 1] ^ code [i]得到的就是异或前的code[i]</p><p>从后往前异或完得到的就是num</p><p>然后分析第一个循环</p><p>num &#x3D; (input[i] + i) % 128</p><p>反着算就是flag</p><p>num &#x3D; (input[i] - i) % 128</p><p>编写exp</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">code = [<span class="string">&#x27;\x1f&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;\x12&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;\x1d&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;(&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;0&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;4&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;\x01&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;\x06&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;\x14&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;4&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;,&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;\x1b&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;U&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;?&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;o&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;6&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;*&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;:&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;\x01&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;D&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;;&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;%&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;\x13&#x27;</span>]</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">len</span> = <span class="built_in">len</span>(code)</span><br><span class="line">flag = <span class="string">&#x27;&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="built_in">len</span> - <span class="number">2</span>, -<span class="number">1</span>, -<span class="number">1</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    code[i] = <span class="built_in">chr</span>(<span class="built_in">ord</span>(code[i]) ^ <span class="built_in">ord</span>(code[i + <span class="number">1</span>]))</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="built_in">len</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    flag += <span class="built_in">chr</span>((<span class="built_in">ord</span>(code[i]) - i )% <span class="number">128</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(flag)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]>
    </content>
